### fpx-server REST API (VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains HTTP client format)
@host = http://localhost:8080
@key = change-me

### Health
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Stats
GET {{host}}/v1/stats
X-API-Key: {{key}}

### Extract (image -> template, optional WSQ). image = base64 BMP/PGM/TIFF/WSQ
POST {{host}}/v1/extract
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"image": "<base64 image>", "dpi": 500, "format": "ansi", "wsq": true}

### Enrol / replace (template preferred; "image" also accepted)
PUT {{host}}/v1/subjects/customer-42
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"template": "<base64 ANSI-378 or ISO-19794-2>"}

### 1:N identification
POST {{host}}/v1/identify
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"template": "<base64>", "top_k": 5}

### 1:1 verification against an enrolled id
POST {{host}}/v1/verify
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": "customer-42", "template": "<base64>"}

### 1:1 of two templates (nothing stored)
POST {{host}}/v1/match
X-API-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"a": "<base64>", "b": "<base64>"}

### Delete
DELETE {{host}}/v1/subjects/customer-42
X-API-Key: {{key}}
